			press? <=> node_press? null
			move? <=> node_move? null
			release? <=> node_release? null
		- Above the overlay and outside its hole, so a wire crossing the picked part
		- is not cut. Takes no pointer: the press on a dot is the overlay's, by geometry.
		<= Wire $bog_vmap_app_wire
			lines <= wire_lines /$bog_vmap_app_wire_line
			dots <= wire_dots /$bog_vmap_app_wire_dot
			drag_geometry <= wire_drag_geometry \
		- Failures of the scene, each on the node it belongs to. Above everything,
		- because a node that threw is what the eye has to be sent to first.
		<= Marks $mol_view
			sub <= error_marks /$mol_view
	- A failure sits at the corner of the node that caused it, and carries the text
